# fx/stab: the Glint at the tip (the dagger's effect, `fx stab`: STYLE_P2 12's Glint, renamed because `fx glint` is the
# living finish's edge spark (FINISH); core #FFFFFF, body #FFF6D8, halo #FFE9A8): the glint at the point at full
# reach with a short streak back along the blade; the follow a 3 px fading twinkle.
# Tones (contracts 4, STYLE_P2 25.10): C edge (fx 0), B body (fx 1), A core (fx 2) are A3's three; S (fx 3) and T (fx 4)
# are the family's accents (named below). art_fx draws the map in the family's own ramp (STYLE_P2 6's named colours) and the
# finisher (hit 3) in the #FFE6A0 tint. a1 is the impact (the strike frame: full width), a2 the follow's first frame
# (thinning, debris falling); nothing on later frames. Side views drawn facing right, L mirrored (FX carry no light); U is
# D mirrored a row higher, behind the body. Pivot-relative: every pixel above the sole row (y -1 or higher), inside the
# figure's box plus the family's reach (rig(2).reach).
# Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h. (P2c wave 2, FX round 1)
use person
body adult
role fx stab
layer fx
anchor pivot
keys fx
legend S fx 3
legend T fx 4

view R key a1 origin -3 15 layer fx
|..........C..
|..........B..
|CCBBB....BAB.
|........CBAAB
|CCBBB....BAB.
|..........B..
|..........C..

view L key a1 origin 15 15 layer fx
|..C..........
|..B..........
|.BAB....BBBCC
|BAABC........
|.BAB....BBBCC
|..B..........
|..C..........

view D key a1 origin 7 15 layer fx
|...C...
|...B...
|..BAB..
|CBAAABC
|..BAB..
|...B...
|...C...

view U key a1 origin -1 16 layer fxBack
|...C...
|...B...
|..BAB..
|CBAAABC
|..BAB..
|...B...
|...C...

view R key a2 origin -12 13 layer fx
|.C.
|CAC
|.C.

view L key a2 origin 14 13 layer fx
|.C.
|CAC
|.C.

view D key a2 origin 5 13 layer fx
|.C.
|CAC
|.C.

view U key a2 origin -3 14 layer fxBack
|.C.
|CAC
|.C.
